# Everything text checks out LF everywhere. Without it, Git for Windows'
# core.autocrlf=true would hand a Windows checkout CRLF shell scripts; this
# repo has no Windows CI leg, but the same default would still hand a Windows
# *contributor's* local checkout CRLF versions of scripts/*.sh and docker/*,
# which shellcheck and hadolint both run against unmodified in CI - cheap
# correctness either way.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.webp binary
